{
  "schema": "loom.runtime_profile/1",
  "domain": "intent_routing",
  "revision": 1,
  "description": "Everything from the conversation window (R54, GRAF_HUB_KOD_SILNIK §8): every chat input goes through input.route_intent, which decides message or command and, for a command, resolves it against the action catalogue and the rules and answers IN the conversation with a proposal. This profile is the data of that decision. method: heuristic (local and free: explicit command syntax, patterns, and the phrases that actions carry in the catalogue; no model call; the preset), model (one use_model call with the configured model, guarded like every other), hybrid (the local reading first, the model only for what it is unsure of; recommended once a provider key exists), off (every input is a message). The method is a setting: config key `intent_routing_method`, then the preset below; the call may override it. execution: whether a proposal waits for the user's yes (propose, the preset), runs at once when the whole plan only reads and the rules ask for nothing (read_only), or runs at once whatever it does (always); the rules and the x10 usage confirmation apply in every case. Confirmation is a reply that is exactly one of the yes / no words below. A phrase on an action is space-separated words, all of which must occur within `window_tokens` of the start with at least one within `lead_tokens`; a word ending in * matches any continuation; text is lower-cased and the letters in `fold` are replaced before matching. A chat input is a command only when it names an action AND an element (an id, or a word that refers to the conversation or a message); otherwise it is a message and continues on the chat path unchanged. All numbers here are calibration, not limits: the user's overlay <data>/profiles/intent_routing.pack changes any of them.",
  "defaults": {
    "method": {
      "setting": "intent_routing_method",
      "active": "heuristic",
      "presets": {
        "off": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Off: every input is a message",
            "pl": "Wyłączone: każde wejście jest wiadomością"
          }
        },
        "heuristic": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Local: explicit syntax and phrases, no model call",
            "pl": "Lokalnie: jawna składnia i frazy, bez wywołania modelu"
          }
        },
        "model": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Model: one model call per input (guarded like every other)",
            "pl": "Model: jedno wywołanie modelu na wejście (pod tym samym zabezpieczeniem)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "P31: with local_first true the model method reads locally first and asks the model only when ask_when says so (unsure: a candidate between heuristic.scoring.min_score and confident_score; no_candidate: nothing found), so a command the local reading is sure of costs no routing call. The preset is false: one model call per input, as the label says.",
            "pl": "P31: przy local_first równym true metoda modelowa najpierw czyta lokalnie i pyta model tylko wtedy, gdy mówi to ask_when (unsure: kandydat między heuristic.scoring.min_score a confident_score; no_candidate: nic nie znaleziono), więc polecenie, którego odczyt lokalny jest pewien, nie kosztuje wywołania routingu. Preset to false: jedno wywołanie modelu na wejście, jak mówi etykieta."
          },
          "local_first": false,
          "ask_when": [
            "unsure",
            "no_candidate"
          ]
        },
        "hybrid": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Hybrid: local first; the model is asked only when the local reading is unsure (recommended once a provider key exists)",
            "pl": "Hybrydowo: najpierw lokalnie; model pytany tylko, gdy odczyt lokalny jest niepewny (zalecane, gdy jest klucz dostawcy)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "The local reading runs first. A command it is sure of (a known action and an element, score at or above heuristic.scoring.confident_score) is never overridden by a model's verdict of message. The model is asked only when the local reading is unsure: a candidate scoring between heuristic.scoring.min_score and confident_score. ask_when lists when the model is asked: unsure (preset) and no_candidate (off in the preset: a sentence the local reading does not recognise at all is an ordinary message and costs no routing call). An unknown command shape still gets the definition offer, whatever the model says.",
            "pl": "Najpierw czyta lokalny odczyt. Polecenia, którego jest pewien (znana akcja i element, wynik co najmniej heuristic.scoring.confident_score), werdykt modelu „wiadomość” nigdy nie unieważnia. Model jest pytany tylko, gdy odczyt lokalny jest niepewny: kandydat z wynikiem między heuristic.scoring.min_score a confident_score. ask_when mówi, kiedy pytać model: unsure (preset) i no_candidate (w presecie wyłączone: zdanie, którego odczyt lokalny w ogóle nie rozpoznaje, jest zwykłą wiadomością i nie kosztuje wywołania routingu). Nieznany kształt polecenia nadal dostaje ofertę definicji, cokolwiek powie model."
          },
          "recommended_when": "provider_key",
          "ask_when": [
            "unsure"
          ]
        }
      },
      "model_setting": "intent_routing_model",
      "model_fallback_setting": "default_model"
    },
    "execution": {
      "setting": "intent_routing_run",
      "active": "propose",
      "presets": {
        "propose": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Propose first, run after the user's yes",
            "pl": "Najpierw propozycja, wykonanie po „tak”"
          }
        },
        "read_only": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Run at once when the plan only reads and the rules ask for nothing",
            "pl": "Od razu, gdy plan tylko czyta, a zasady o nic nie pytają"
          }
        },
        "always": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Run at once (rules and the x10 confirmation still apply)",
            "pl": "Od razu (zasady i potwierdzenie ×10 nadal obowiązują)"
          }
        }
      },
      "direct": [
        "help.can_do",
        "help.how_to",
        "context.modify",
        "context.receipt",
        "window.open",
        "window.close",
        "window.focus",
        "window.next",
        "window.prev"
      ]
    },
    "on_reject": {
      "setting": "intent_routing_on_reject",
      "active": "offer",
      "unknown": "offer",
      "presets": {
        "offer": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Offer: after a no, ask whether to send the sentence to the model as an ordinary message",
            "pl": "Propozycja: po „nie” zapytaj, czy wysłać zdanie do modelu jako zwykłą wiadomość"
          }
        },
        "send_as_message": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Send: after a no, send the sentence to the model as an ordinary message at once",
            "pl": "Wyślij: po „nie” od razu wyślij zdanie do modelu jako zwykłą wiadomość"
          }
        },
        "drop": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Drop: after a no, the sentence is not sent (it stays in the conversation)",
            "pl": "Odrzuć: po „nie” zdanie nie jest wysyłane (zostaje w rozmowie)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "emergent": {
      "setting": "emergent_actions",
      "active": "propose",
      "presets": {
        "off": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Off: the catalogue never grows from conversations",
            "pl": "Wyłączone: katalog nie rośnie z rozmów"
          }
        },
        "propose": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Propose: new actions, sequences and groups are offered, never made silently",
            "pl": "Propozycje: nowe akcje, sekwencje i grupy są proponowane, nigdy po cichu"
          }
        }
      },
